{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"ruby","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Ruby","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Ruby (.rb .rake .gemspec .ru).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"ruby","name":"Ruby","extensions":[".rb",".rake",".gemspec",".ru",".erb"],"grammar":"grammars/ruby.json","filenames":["Gemfile","Rakefile","Guardfile","Vagrantfile","Podfile"],"lineComment":"#","blockComment":["=begin","=end"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Ruby","path":"snippets/ruby.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/ruby.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"=begin\",\n      \"end\": \"=end\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"`(?:[^`\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*`\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \":[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*[?!]?\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@@?[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:defined\\\\?|__FILE__|__LINE__|ensure|module|rescue|return|unless|alias|begin|BEGIN|break|class|elsif|retry|super|undef|until|while|yield|case|else|next|redo|self|then|when|and|def|end|END|for|not|do|if|in|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|nil)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Comparable|Enumerable|Integer|String|Symbol|Struct|Kernel|Object|Module|Array|Float|Range|Class|Hash|Proc)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:require_relative|attr_accessor|attr_reader|attr_writer|require|include|extend|lambda|print|raise|puts|proc|loop|pp|p)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/ruby.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Method\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"def\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"def ${1:name}(${2:args})\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A method\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cls\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name}\",\n      \"\\tdef initialize(${2:args})\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\tend\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  },\n  \"Module\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"module ${1:Name}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A module\"\n  },\n  \"Each\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"each\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:items}.each do |${2:item}|\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"each block\"\n  },\n  \"Map\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"map\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:items}.map { |${2:x}| $0 }\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"map block\"\n  },\n  \"If\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"if\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"if ${1:condition}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"if\"\n  },\n  \"Attr accessor\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"attr\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"attr_accessor :${1:name}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"attr_accessor\"\n  },\n  \"RSpec describe\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"desc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"describe ${1:Subject} do\",\n      \"\\tit \\\"${2:works}\\\" do\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\tend\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An RSpec group\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Ruby\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Ruby.\n\n## Files\n\n`.rb`, `.rake`, `.gemspec`, `.ru`, `.erb`, `Gemfile`, `Rakefile`, `Guardfile`, `Vagrantfile`, `Podfile`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 8 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `def` | A method |\n| `cls` | A class |\n| `mod` | A module |\n| `each` | each block |\n| `map` | map block |\n| `if` | if |\n| `attr` | attr_accessor |\n| `desc` | An RSpec group |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}